abstract: >-
  Independent companion software: figure-to-evidence map, synthetic fixtures, rule and Isolation Forest baselines,
  an illustrative Bayesian risk graph, analyst-review triage and a SWaT loader. It is not the article authors' code,
  not their trained system, and does not reproduce their figures; see docs/paper-map.md.
